{"version":1,"content":"\n<p>Weather Cafe 是一款把天氣預報放進咖啡館場景的應用程式，適合外出前想快速掌握天氣、又不想面對廣告與繁複選單的使用者。它提供每小時與 5 日預報、天氣警報及全球城市搜尋，原價 US $0.99，現時<a href=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/category/apps-%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/%E9%99%90%E6%99%82%E5%85%8D%E8%B2%BB%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">限時免費</a>。</p>\n<figure><img alt=\"限時免費\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"460\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/460x460Icon-Ap-SiOS01-75-195.webp\" width=\"460\"/></figure>\n<h2>咖啡館場景結合即時天氣</h2>\n<p>打開 Weather Cafe 後，畫面會隨實際天氣切換咖啡館背景，直接顯示目前狀況、未來 3 小時及明日展望。滑動預報卡可查看 5 日高低溫、天氣圖示與降雨或降雪機率；應用亦顯示所在地天氣警報，並可查閱日出月升、月相、紫外線及氣壓趨勢。玻璃時鐘可切換指針或數字，並同步所選城市當地時間。</p>\n<figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1320x2868bb-210-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1178\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1320x2868bb-211-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1178\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1320x2868bb-212-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1178\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1320x2868bb-213-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1178\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1320x2868bb-214-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1178\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1320x2868bb-215-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1178\"/></figure></figure>\n<ul><li>應用名稱：Weather Cafe</li><li>應用類別：Weather</li><li>下載位置：<a href=\"https://apps.apple.com/app/weather-cafe/id6759991476?uo=4\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">App Store</a></li></ul>\n","scraped_at":"2026-11-14T23:12:16.597201+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":315,"images":7,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-14T22:49:09+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-15T10:53:36.937902+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-14T23:05:37.830467+00:00","content_hash":"21af55f8754a4d28cc3ca89f30f738353e1360c272a8ef479702bd310456af80","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}